{"date":"1994-12-16","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg"},"summary":"暴雨之夜，小茜（日高のり子 饰）接到一通请求除妖的电话，除妖地点在流幻泽。许多年前，天道一家曾旅行到过流幻泽，小茜在当地森林遇到过恐怖的怪物，关键时刻被一个少年救下，临别时还送给她一个护身符角笛。随着时间的流逝，那段记忆被长久深埋心中。这通电话唤醒了小茜对流幻泽的记忆和好奇，她留下一封信后只身前往。在当地，小茜重逢当时的少年真之介。真之介和爷爷居住在森林中的木屋里，辛苦地与受生命之泉影响而巨大化的动物作斗争。真之介当年为救小茜身负重伤，多亏生命之泉的水得以康复。然而生命之泉即将枯竭，这个少年命在旦夕…… ","name":"らんま1/2 SPECIAL よみがえる記憶","name_cn":"乱马1/2 苏醒的记忆","tags":[{"name":"OVA","count":63,"total_count":362812},{"name":"1994","count":29,"total_count":4238},{"name":"乱马","count":21,"total_count":790},{"name":"漫画改","count":21,"total_count":853543},{"name":"studiodeen","count":21,"total_count":26470},{"name":"搞笑","count":18,"total_count":633053},{"name":"漫改","count":14,"total_count":358968},{"name":"恋爱","count":11,"total_count":557640},{"name":"草尾毅","count":8,"total_count":1105},{"name":"日髙のり子","count":8,"total_count":114},{"name":"性转","count":7,"total_count":14389},{"name":"林原惠美","count":6,"total_count":673},{"name":"日本","count":6,"total_count":290754},{"name":"动画","count":4,"total_count":35478},{"name":"西村純二","count":4,"total_count":542},{"name":"后宫","count":3,"total_count":300290},{"name":"战斗","count":3,"total_count":465605},{"name":"高桥留美子","count":3,"total_count":4504},{"name":"1994年12月","count":2,"total_count":10},{"name":"日本动画","count":2,"total_count":34758},{"name":"动作","count":2,"total_count":7619},{"name":"山口亮太","count":2,"total_count":148},{"name":"奇幻","count":2,"total_count":464340},{"name":"日常","count":2,"total_count":395952},{"name":"笑死","count":1,"total_count":37},{"name":"林原めぐみ","count":1,"total_count":2342},{"name":"古橋一浩","count":1,"total_count":694},{"name":"中嶋敦子","count":1,"total_count":143},{"name":"